      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The \"Creator\" tag did sounds weird to me too, just didn't think too much about it before now. It does sound weirdly exclusive of other content creators.\n\nI can see the intention is to have to label users as \"Creator Economy Participants\", and I guess just calling the that is too long. It could be changed to something like \"CE Seller\" maybe.\n\nAt the very least, the \"Creator\" tag needs to have tooltip explaining that it means the user has stuff for sale in VRChat's Creator Economy program. Could even make it click-able, so it opens the avatar marketplace or whichever for the user.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
