      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think it's mostly fine how it is, just put a tooltip explaining what it is.\n\nIf it's given to creators outside of the Creator Economy, there should at least be more stringent requirements for it, like having an actual shop or a decent number of popular public avatars or worlds uploaded.\n\nGiving it to anyone who simply uploads content would be pointless, it's too low of a bar since anyone can do that without even being a creator.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
